Hello everyone! 

We are reporting back with a new patch for Shiny! 
Most of the issues that were fixed were found thanks to you and your bug reports in our Steam forums. We would like to thank all the players who took a time out of their day to let us know and thus improve the game for everyone! 

Here's the full changelist

[h3]Gameplay:[/h3]
[list]
[*] Jet-Pack velocity fixed;
[*] Fixed the immortal jet-pack bug;
[*] Fixed button bug on the play menu;
[*] Fixed the multiple-choices bug on Main Menu;
[*] Fixed camera bug on the first level;
[*] Fixed the battery that was missing on the last level, it is now there;
[*] Fixed minor visual corruptions from Level 9 - 12;
[*] Fixed freeze-bug when the player jumps around the spawn point on Level 01;
[*] Power Sphere gameplay rebalanced;
[*] Fixed The UI buttons icons for all levels;
[*] Updated the Credits Screen.
[/list]

[h3]Achievements:[/h3]
[list]
[*] Fixed "It's Over, Go Home" achievement trigger on the game credits;
[*] Fixed minor bugs on achievement actions such as on "Hot Tempered", "Cool head", "Go ahead and jump", "Joy The Ride" and "2 Percenter";
[*] Added 2 batteries in the first level, now total of 30 batteries;
[*] Added 3 batteries in the second level, now total of 58 batteries;
[*] Added 3 batteries in the third level, now total of 25 batteries.
[/list]

[h3]Localizations and etc:[/h3]
[list]
[*] Added Danish, Finnish, Japanese and Swedish languages;
[*] Fixed several localization problems and cutoff problems;
[*] Fixed word scaling on several UI screens;
[*] Fixed the sizes of the words;
[*] Fixed the level's titles in the Finished Level Screen for all languages;
[/list]
